    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47035",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Alarum, as in battle. Enter Martius and Aufidius at several doors.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 28,
          "end": 35,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 40,
          "end": 48,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47035/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 66,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 866747,
        "end": 866903,
        "line": 32691,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47035",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47195",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nI’ll fight with none but thee, for I do hate thee\nWorse than a promise-breaker.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47195/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47195/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47195/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 866907,
        "end": 867030,
        "line": 32696,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47195",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47322",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUFIDIUS.\nWe hate alike.\nNot Afric owns a serpent I abhor\nMore than thy fame and envy. Fix thy foot.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47322/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47322/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47322/line-3",
          "start": 25,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47322/line-4",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 100,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867034,
        "end": 867174,
        "line": 32702,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47322",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUFIDIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47466",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nLet the first budger die the other’s slave,\nAnd the gods doom him after!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47466/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47466/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47466/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 81,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867178,
        "end": 867294,
        "line": 32709,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47466",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47586",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUFIDIUS.\nIf I fly, Martius,\nHollo me like a hare.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47586/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47586/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47586/line-3",
          "start": 29,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867298,
        "end": 867383,
        "line": 32715,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47586",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUFIDIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTIUS.\nWithin these three hours, Tullus,\nAlone I fought in your Corioles’ walls,\nAnd made what work I pleased. ’Tis not my blood\nWherein thou seest me masked. For thy revenge\nWrench up thy power to th’ highest.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-3",
          "start": 43,
          "end": 82,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-4",
          "start": 83,
          "end": 130,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-5",
          "start": 131,
          "end": 176,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47675/line-6",
          "start": 177,
          "end": 212,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867387,
        "end": 867649,
        "line": 32721,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47675",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47941",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUFIDIUS.\nWert thou the Hector\nThat was the whip of your bragged progeny,\nThou shouldst not scape me here.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47941/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47941/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47941/line-3",
          "start": 31,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@47941/line-4",
          "start": 74,
          "end": 106,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867653,
        "end": 867799,
        "line": 32730,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@47941",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUFIDIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48091",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Here they fight, and certain Volsces come to the aid of Aufidius.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 65,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 66
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48091/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867803,
        "end": 867929,
        "line": 32737,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@48091",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48221",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Officious and not valiant, you have shamed me\nIn your condemned seconds.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48221/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48221/line-2",
          "start": 46,
          "end": 72,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 867933,
        "end": 868035,
        "line": 32740,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@48221",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.8"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.8/p@48327",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Martius fights till they be driven in breathless. Aufidius and Martius exit, separately.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
